{
  "id": "abstract-word",
  "term": "abstract word",
  "definition": "An abstract word is a word whose meaning is tied more to events, mental states, or context than to a specific, clearly bounded object. In this account, abstract words are understood as depending less on direct sensorimotor experience and more on situational and introspective information.",
